   "en": "Decision memo · Japan"
  },
  "title": {
   "zh": "暂不加投日本站广告：先修复转化，再按 ACOS 门槛分批加投",
   "en": "Hold extra Japan ad spend: fix conversion first, then scale in steps against an ACOS gate"
  },
  "date": "2026-01-08",
  "author": {
   "zh": "BizOS 经营分析",
   "en": "BizOS Operations Analytics"
  }
 },
 "question": {
  "zh": "2026 年上半年是否把日本站广告预算提高 50%？",
  "en": "Should we raise Japan’s ad budget by 50% in H1 2026?"
 },
 "recommendation": {
  "zh": "暂不加投。先用 6 周修复前五 ASIN 的转化率；转化率恢复到 2024 年水平且 ACOS ≤ 22% 后，按每月 +15% 分批加投。",
  "en": "Not yet. Spend six weeks restoring conversion on the top five ASINs; once it is back to 2024 levels and ACOS ≤ 22%, scale up 15% a month."
 },
 "summary": [
  {
   "zh": "日本站月销售额 2025 年下降 8%，是六个站点中唯一下滑的市场（图表 1）。",
   "en": "Japan’s monthly sales fell 8% over 2025, the only declining marketplace of six (Exhibit 1)."
  },
  {
   "zh": "下滑来自转化：前五 ASIN 转化率全部下降，最多 2.7 个百分点（图表 2）。",
   "en": "The decline is conversion-led: all five top ASINs converted worse, by up to 2.7 points (Exhibit 2)."
  },
  {
   "zh": "在当前转化率下加投 50% 预算会使利润下降约 12 万美元；转化率每提升 1 个百分点则增加约 17 万美元（图表 3）。",
   "en": "At today’s conversion, +50% budget would cut profit by about US$120k; each conversion point adds about US$170k (Exhibit 3)."
  }
 ],
